      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You need to immediately reframe the narrative to focus on fiscal responsibility rather than outright opposition to the goal. Spin the \"no\" vote around \"responsible budget prioritization\" for the *future* of the community, perhaps by implying the current plan was unsustainable or mismanaged.\n\nEmphasize that the goal is a *better, more secure* future for the center, which might require a different, more viable proposal to be put forward. This shifts the focus from \"against the community\" to \"committed to *better* community needs and responsible governance.\"",
